LINES = ["In 1994, half of this country deleted New Year's Eve.", 'Kiribati was split by the date line, so its east was almost a day behind.', 'The two halves could do business only four days a week.', 'So it moved the line around the whole country. Friday, December thirtieth, was followed by Sunday, January first.', 'Now its islands greet every new year before any other country.', "And the east? No New Year's Eve party in 1994. Sorry. Business first."]
